# Credentials. `.env` alone does NOT match `.env.bak.<ts>`, which is what the key-rotation
# script writes — two of those were sitting untracked with live FAL/Groq keys in them on
# 2026-07-29 and would have been committed by a `git add -A`. Ignore the whole family and
# re-admit only the example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# design reference bundle — a copy of ~/Downloads/frameforge-redesign, not app code
frameforge-redesign DESIGN EXMPLE/

# Local Cloudflare/miniflare emulator state for the landing page's R2 bucket. This is the blob
# table the beta bug-report screenshots upload into during local dev, so it holds real captures —
# binary, machine-local, and never source. It was untracked and unignored on 2026-07-30, meaning
# one `git add -A` would have put dev screen captures into permanent history.
.wrangler/
